# BOSS INTRO — the party steps into the arena past The Long Crossing.
# `emit maw_wake` wakes the boss (MawBoss listens for its wake_event).
# The arena gate seals by itself once the Maw is awake.

letterbox on
camera 5420 -470 1.0
wait 0.6
emote fairy "?"
say fairy "The air's folding. Something huge is pushing through."
emit maw_wake
wait 1.8
say mafia "That's not a portal. That's a mouth."
say fairy "The Maw. It feeds where our worlds touch. Its heart keeps shifting between sun and moon."
say fairy "When it glows gold, only your Solar eye can find it. Silver-blue, only mine."
if upgrade heavy_rounds
	say mafia "Then we take turns looking. And I brought the heavy rounds."
else
	say mafia "Then we take turns looking."
end
camera_reset
letterbox off
